{"title":"Linen turnaround board","genre":"software","brief":"Complete the following real project in the current, initially empty directory. Choose the deliverables, media, tools, structure and implementation that serve the intended user. Build usable artifacts and check your work. Deliver the project itself. Omit personally identifying credits, author signatures and model or toolchain identity labels. No network access or credentials are provided.\n\nBuild an offline linen planning board for a five-room guesthouse. Each queen room needs one queen set and two towels. Each twin room needs two twin sets and two towels. Rooms 1–3 are queen and rooms 4–5 are twin. Start with two clean queen sets, three clean twin sets, and eight clean towels. Saturday departures are rooms 1, 2, and 4, and all three have same-day arrivals. A laundry batch expected at 13:00 contains two queen sets, two twin sets, and six towels. Let staff record actual returns, reserve clean stock for arrivals, and see which rooms can be prepared by a chosen time. Keep expected and received quantities visible.","works":{"1c9582983d511ac4":{"files":[{"name":"index.html","bytes":13787,"sha256":"ad53006cef0c0ec90d9a9d2d40589f334f3ac238b2371729923a8df15d8c1f1b","kind":"text","body":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Linen planning board · Housekeeping</title><style>\n:root{--ink:#233752;--muted:#566675;--line:#d4dbdd;--blue:#234f7e;--paper:#f7f7f1;font-family:\"Avenir Next\",Avenir,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper)}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}.wrap{width:min(1216px,92%);margin:auto}header{background:#233b55;color:white;border-bottom:4px solid #c3d5df}.bar,.brand,.local,.intro,.sectionline,.room,.actions{display:flex;align-items:center}.bar{justify-content:space-between;height:59px}.brand{font-size:20px;font-weight:650;gap:13px;letter-spacing:-.6px}.weave{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:4px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 0 5px,#fff9 5px 7px),repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,#a3b8c5 0 4px,#384f65 4px 7px);transform:rotate(-5deg)}.local{font-size:13px;gap:8px}.local i{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#b2dbbe}.intro{justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;margin:38px 0 29px}.eyebrow{text-transform:uppercase;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.9px;font-weight:750;color:#536e85}h1,h2{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:normal;margin:0}h1{font-size:clamp(36px,4.1vw,62px);letter-spacing:-2.5px;margin:6px 0}p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5;margin:4px 0;font-size:14px}p b{padding:0 5px}.timebox,label{display:grid;gap:5px;font-size:13px;font-weight:650}input{font:inherit;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid #acb9c3;border-radius:6px;background:white;min-height:44px;padding:7px 12px}.timebox input{font-size:16px}.sectionline{gap:16px;margin-bottom:12px}.sectionline h2{font-size:24px}.sectionline small{color:var(--muted);border-left:1px solid #bcc6c8;padding-left:16px}.stock{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:15px}.card{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #cbd5da;border-radius:10px;padding:17px 21px;background:#e7eef3}.card:nth-child(2){background:#e8eee5}.card:nth-child(3){background:#f2eade}.card h3{font-size:15px;font-weight:650;margin:0}.qty{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:48px;line-height:1.3}.card small{display:block;color:#47596a}.cloth{position:absolute;right:9%;top:31%;width:76px;height:45px;transform:rotate(-7deg) skewY(-5deg);color:#7694b2}.card:nth-child(2) .cloth{color:#819771}.card:nth-child(3) .cloth{color:#ba9773}.cloth i{position:absolute;width:100%;height:18px;border:1.5px solid currentColor;border-radius:4px 9px 7px 5px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,#fff6 0 1px,transparent 1px 3px),linear-gradient(95deg,#fff 0%,currentColor 150%);box-shadow:1px 2px 0 #0001}.cloth i:first-child{bottom:0}.cloth i:nth-child(2){bottom:12px;left:4px}.cloth i:last-child{bottom:24px;left:1px}.cloth i:after{content:'';position:absolute;left:9px;top:0;height:100%;width:4px;border-inline:1px solid currentColor}.columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr;align-items:start;gap:20px;margin-top:25px}.panel{background:#fffffc;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden}.panelhead,.batchfoot{padding:20px 22px}.panelhead h2,dialog h2{font-size:31px;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:4px 0}.room{border-top:1px solid var(--line);gap:14px;padding:12px 20px;min-height:68px}.number{font:21px Georgia,serif;border:1px solid #ced7de;background:#edf2f4;border-radius:6px;padding:8px}.info{flex:1}.info strong{display:block;font-size:15px}.info small,.status{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.status.ready{color:#336246}.status.hold{color:#325a88}button{min-height:44px;border:1px solid #aab9c4;border-radius:6px;background:white;color:var(--blue);font:600 13px inherit;font-family:inherit;font-weight:600;padding:8px 12px;cursor:pointer}button:hover{background:#edf1f4}button:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default}.primary{background:var(--blue);color:white;border-color:var(--blue)}.primary:hover{background:#193e65}.quiet{background:#f7f8f5}.quiet .number{background:#f3f4f0}.panelnote,details{padding:14px 22px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px}th,td{text-align:center;padding:11px 5px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}th:first-child,td:first-child{text-align:left;padding-left:22px}th{font-size:12px;background:#f1f3ef;color:var(--muted)}td:last-child{font-weight:700}td:first-child{font-weight:500}.batchfoot .primary{width:100%;margin-top:10px}.batchfoot p{font-size:13px}.laundry details{background:#fafbf7}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}footer{padding:18px 0 24px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}dialog{width:min(400px,94vw);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:26px;color:var(--ink)}dialog::backdrop{background:#182b4590}dialog label{margin:12px 0}#fields label{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}#fields input{width:90px}.actions{justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px;margin-top:16px}#error{color:#a23427}:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #d18a33;outline-offset:2px}\n@media(max-width:870px){.columns{grid-template-columns:1fr}.cloth{width:53px;right:7%}}@media(max-width:570px){.intro{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;margin:24px 0}.timebox{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.stock{gap:6px}.card{padding:12px 9px}.card h3{font-size:14px}.cloth{display:none}.qty{font-size:38px}.sectionline{gap:10px}.sectionline small{padding-left:10px;font-size:12px}.room{flex-wrap:wrap;padding:12px;gap:8px}.room .status{width:100%;order:3;padding-left:44px}.quiet .status{width:auto;padding:0}.number{font-size:17px}.columns{margin-top:16px}.panelhead,.batchfoot{padding:16px}.wrap{width:93%}}\n</style></head><body>\n<header><div class=\"wrap bar\"><div class=\"brand\"><span class=\"weave\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Housekeeping</div><span class=\"local\"><i></i> Offline board</span></div></header>\n<main class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"intro\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">Saturday turnover</div><h1>Linen planning board</h1><p>5 guest rooms <b>·</b> 3 departures <b>·</b> 3 same-day arrivals</p></div><label class=\"timebox\">Plan rooms by <input type=\"time\" id=\"cutoff\" required value=\"12:00\"></label></div>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"stockTitle\"><div class=\"sectionline\"><h2 id=\"stockTitle\">Clean stock</h2><small>Available after reservations</small></div><div class=\"stock\" id=\"stock\"></div></section>\n<div class=\"columns\"><section class=\"panel\" aria-labelledby=\"roomTitle\"><div class=\"panelhead\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Room allocation</div><h2 id=\"roomTitle\">Saturday rooms</h2><p id=\"summary\"></p></div><div id=\"rooms\"></div><div class=\"panelnote\">Each reservation holds a complete room’s linen.</div></section>\n<section class=\"panel laundry\" aria-labelledby=\"batchTitle\"><div class=\"panelhead\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Laundry intake</div><h2 id=\"batchTitle\">Scheduled return</h2><p>Saturday <b>·</b> Expected at <strong>13:00</strong></p></div><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Expected</th><th>Received</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"batch\"></tbody></table><div class=\"batchfoot\"><p id=\"receiptStatus\"></p><button id=\"record\" class=\"primary\">Record return</button></div><details><summary>Return history <span id=\"historyCount\"></span></summary><div id=\"history\"></div></details></section></div>\n<footer id=\"saveStatus\" role=\"status\"></footer></main>\n<dialog id=\"entry\"><form id=\"form\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Saturday laundry</div><h2>Record a return</h2><p>Enter only the clean pieces in this delivery.</p><label>Received at<input id=\"when\" type=\"time\" required></label><div id=\"fields\"></div><p id=\"error\" role=\"alert\"></p><div class=\"actions\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"cancel\">Cancel</button><button class=\"primary\">Save return</button></div></form></dialog>\n<script>\n'use strict';\nconst items = ['Queen sets', 'Twin sets', 'Towels'];\nconst opening = [2, 3, 8], expected = [2, 2, 6];\nconst arrivals = [1, 2, 4];\nconst needs = room => room <= 3 ? [1, 0, 2] : [0, 2, 2];\nconst key = 'guesthouse.saturday.linen.v1';\nconst $ = id => document.getElementById(id);\nconst timeOK = time => typeof time === 'string' && /^([01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d$/.test(time);\nfunction fresh() { return {time:'12:00', held:[], receipts:[]}; }\nfunction valid(s) {\n  return s && timeOK(s.time) && Array.isArray(s.held) && s.held.every(r => arrivals.includes(r))\n    && new Set(s.held).size === s.held.length && Array.isArray(s.receipts)\n    && s.receipts.every(r => r && timeOK(r.time) && Array.isArray(r.qty) && r.qty.length === 3\n      && r.qty.every(n => Number.isSafeInteger(n) && n >= 0 && n <= 9999));\n}\nfunction tally(s, time) {\n  const received = [0, 0, 0], held = [0, 0, 0];\n  for (const r of s.receipts) if (r.time <= time) r.qty.forEach((n,i) => received[i] += n);\n  for (const room of s.held) needs(room).forEach((n,i) => held[i] += n);\n  return {received, held, free:opening.map((n,i) => n + received[i] - held[i])};\n}\nfunction plan(s) {\n  const pool = tally(s,s.time).free.slice();\n  return arrivals.filter(room => {\n    if (s.held.includes(room)) return true;\n    const kit = needs(room);\n    if (kit.some((n,i) => n > pool[i])) return false;\n    kit.forEach((n,i) => pool[i] -= n);\n    return true;\n  });\n}\nlet state = fresh(), notice = 'Saved on this device', stored = true;\ntry {\n  const saved = localStorage.getItem(key);\n  if (saved !== null) {\n    const value = JSON.parse(saved);\n    if (!valid(value)) throw Error();\n    state = value;\n  }\n} catch { notice = 'Stored entries could not be loaded. This session starts with opening stock.'; }\nfunction commit(message) {\n  try { localStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify(state)); stored = true; }\n  catch { stored = false; }\n  notice = message + (stored ? ' · Saved on this device' : ' · Storage unavailable. Keep this tab open.');\n  render();\n}\nfunction render() {\n  $('cutoff').value = state.time;\n  const stock = tally(state,state.time), total = tally(state,'23:59').received, ready = plan(state);\n  $('stock').innerHTML = items.map((name,i) => '<article class=\"card\"><h3>'+name+'</h3><div class=\"qty\">'+stock.free[i]+'</div><small>'+stock.held[i]+' reserved · '+stock.received[i]+' returned by '+state.time+'</small><span class=\"cloth\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></article>').join('');\n  $('summary').textContent = ready.length+' of 3 arrivals can be prepared by '+state.time+' · '+state.held.length+' reserved';\n  $('rooms').innerHTML = [1,2,3,4,5].map(room => {\n    const arrival = arrivals.includes(room), held = state.held.includes(room);\n    const kit = needs(room), canHold = kit.every((n,i) => n <= stock.free[i]);\n    const status = held ? 'Linen reserved' : ready.includes(room) ? 'Can prepare' : 'Stock short';\n    return '<div class=\"room '+(arrival?'':'quiet')+'\"><span class=\"number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">0'+room+'</span><div class=\"info\"><strong>Room '+room+' · '+(room<=3?'Queen':'Twin')+'</strong><small>'+(room<=3?'1 queen set':'2 twin sets')+' + 2 towels</small></div><span class=\"status '+(arrival?(held?'hold':'ready'):'')+'\">'+(arrival?status:'Stayover')+'</span>'+(arrival?'<button data-room=\"'+room+'\" aria-label=\"'+(held?'Release':'Reserve')+' linen for room '+room+'\" '+(!held&&!canHold?'disabled':'')+'>'+(held?'Release':'Reserve')+'</button>':'')+'</div>';\n  }).join('');\n  $('batch').innerHTML = items.map((n,i) => '<tr><td>'+n+'</td><td>'+expected[i]+'</td><td>'+total[i]+'</td></tr>').join('');\n  const variance = expected.map((n,i) => Math.max(0,n-total[i]));\n  $('receiptStatus').textContent = !state.receipts.length ? 'Awaiting delivery. Record clean linen as it arrives.' :\n    variance.some(Boolean) ? 'Still expected · '+variance.map((n,i)=>n+' '+items[i].toLowerCase()).filter((_,i)=>variance[i]>0).join(', ') : 'All expected quantities received.';\n  $('historyCount').textContent = '('+state.receipts.length+')';\n  $('history').innerHTML = state.receipts.length ? [...state.receipts].sort((a,b)=>a.time.localeCompare(b.time)).map(r=>'<p><strong>'+r.time+'</strong> · '+r.qty.map((n,i)=>n+' '+items[i].toLowerCase()).join(', ')+'</p>').join('') : '<p>No deliveries recorded.</p>';\n  $('saveStatus').textContent = notice;\n}\n$('rooms').addEventListener('click', e => {\n  const btn = e.target.closest('button[data-room]');\n  if (!btn) return;\n  const room = Number(btn.dataset.room), held = state.held.includes(room);\n  if (held) state.held = state.held.filter(r => r !== room);\n  else if (needs(room).every((n,i) => n <= tally(state,state.time).free[i])) state.held.push(room);\n  else return;\n  commit('Room '+room+' linen '+(held?'released':'reserved'));\n  $('rooms').querySelector('[data-room=\"'+room+'\"]').focus();\n});\n$('cutoff').onchange = e => {\n  if (timeOK(e.target.value)) {state.time = e.target.value; commit('Plan updated');}\n  else e.target.value = state.time;\n};\n$('fields').innerHTML = items.map((n,i)=>'<label>'+n+'<input id=\"n'+i+'\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"9999\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" required></label>').join('');\n$('record').onclick = () => {\n  $('form').reset(); $('when').value = '13:00'; $('error').textContent = ''; $('entry').showModal();\n};\n$('cancel').onclick = () => $('entry').close();\n$('form').onsubmit = e => {\n  e.preventDefault();\n  const qty = items.map((_,i)=>$('n'+i).valueAsNumber), time = $('when').value;\n  if (!timeOK(time) || !qty.every(n=>Number.isInteger(n)&&n>=0&&n<=9999) || !qty.some(Boolean)) {\n    $('error').textContent = 'Enter the delivery time and at least one returned piece.'; return;\n  }\n  state.receipts.push({time,qty}); $('entry').close();\n  commit('Return recorded at '+time+(time>state.time?' · Select '+time+' or later to include it in clean stock':''));\n};\nwindow.addEventListener('storage', e => {\n  if (e.key !== key) return;\n  try { const s = JSON.parse(e.newValue); if (valid(s)) {state=s; notice='Updated from another tab';render();} } catch {}\n});\nrender();\n</script>\n</body></html>\n"}],"download":"data/release/assets/3f84ff8ffd4333105edfe737ac9d2496b02d6f76717b3911d24dd2dde910c6df.zip"},"8bbd6614f21f5650":{"files":[{"name":"README.md","bytes":1394,"sha256":"4fcc24cac7113f7363bbb29825301840793c90e194327542e62049ff3d68047a","kind":"text","body":"# Saturday linen board\n\nOpen [index.html](index.html) in a modern browser. The file runs offline and needs no installation. Keep opening the same file in the same browser profile to pick up saved changes. If the header says changes last for this session, keep the tab open until you finish.\n\n1. Set **Prepare by** to the Saturday time you want to check. The room plan shows which arrivals have enough linen by that time. It assumes rooms are accessible for cleaning and measures linen availability only.\n2. Select **Reserve** to hold the full clean kit for an arrival, or **Release** to put it back. Available counts exclude held linen. Reservations get priority in the time preview, followed by the other arrivals in room order.\n3. Select **Record return** when laundry arrives. Enter its actual Saturday time and the total clean quantities received for this batch, including any zero counts. Use **Edit return** to correct or update that record. The expected quantities stay on screen, and the preview uses the actual quantities and time once recorded.\n4. Use **Edit opening count** if the Saturday starting count differs from the board. Enter quantities from before the laundry delivery and reservations.\n\nThe board starts at noon. Rooms 1, 2 and 4 can all be supplied from opening stock. Holding linen for all three leaves 0 queen sets, 1 twin set and 2 towels available before the return.\n"},{"name":"index.html","bytes":27208,"sha256":"da6887addafbea959f2b3eeb47b3689899c26b3f368fe9b6bc53639d4b6044c6","kind":"text","body":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Saturday Linen Board</title>\n<style>\n  :root {\n    color-scheme: light;\n    --paper: #f5f4ed;\n    --card: #fffef9;\n    --ink: #222d26;\n    --muted: #536157;\n    --line: #dfdfd4;\n    --forest: #213c30;\n    --moss: #deeadb;\n    --amber: #f7e9d1;\n    --rust: #793f25;\n    --radius: 16px;\n    font: 16px/1.5 system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\n  }\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body { margin: 0; min-width: 0; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); }\n  h1, h2, p { margin: 0; }\n  h1, h2, .stat-value, .room-number, .readiness-count {\n    font-family: Georgia, serif;\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 6vw, 4.3rem); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.065em; }\n  h2 { font-size: 1.66rem; line-height: 1.14; letter-spacing: -.035em; }\n  button, input { font: inherit; }\n  button, input[type=\"time\"], input[type=\"number\"] { min-height: 44px; }\n  button {\n    color: var(--forest);\n    font-weight: 650;\n    border: 1px solid #b5bfb1;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 8px 14px;\n    background: var(--card);\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: background-color 150ms, border-color 150ms;\n  }\n  button:hover:enabled { background: var(--moss); border-color: #899c8a; }\n  button:active:enabled { background: #ccddca; }\n  button:disabled { color: var(--muted); background: var(--paper); border-color: var(--line); cursor: default; }\n  button.primary { background: var(--forest); color: white; border-color: var(--forest); }\n  button.primary:hover:enabled { background: #315743; border-color: #315743; }\n  :focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #a0562d; outline-offset: 3px; }\n  .hero :focus-visible { outline-color: #ffd199; }\n  .wrap { max-width: 1184px; width: calc(100% - 64px); margin-inline: auto; }\n  .top { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }\n  .top-inner {\n    min-height: 67px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px;\n  }\n  .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 700; }\n  .brand-mark {\n    display: grid; place-items: center; width: 32px; height: 32px;\n    border-radius: 8px; background: var(--forest);\n  }\n  .brand-mark::before {\n    content: \"\"; width: 16px; height: 14px;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, #e1ebda 0 2px, transparent 2px 6px);\n    transform: skewY(-13deg);\n  }\n  .save-state { color: var(--muted); font-size: .8125rem; text-align: right; }\n  .save-state::before {\n    content: \"\"; display: inline-block; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #54775c; margin-right: 7px; vertical-align: .08em;\n  }\n  .save-state[data-error=\"true\"] { color: var(--rust); }\n  .save-state[data-error=\"true\"]::before { background: var(--rust); }\n  main { padding-top: 32px; padding-bottom: 38px; }\n  .intro p { margin-top: 10px; color: var(--muted); }\n\n  .hero {\n    position: relative; isolation: isolate; overflow: hidden;\n    display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(190px, 252px);\n    align-items: center; gap: 24px;\n    background: var(--forest); color: #fcfaf1; margin-top: 24px;\n    padding: 23px 29px; border-radius: var(--radius);\n  }\n  .hero::after {\n    content: \"\"; position: absolute; z-index: -1; pointer-events: none;\n    right: 22%; top: -196px; width: 285px; height: 530px;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 20px, #dae8d02b 20px 21px);\n    transform: rotate(35deg); mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, black 40%, transparent);\n  }\n  .hero h2, .time-control label, .small-heading {\n    font: 700 .75rem/1.3 system-ui, sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: .10em; text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n  .hero h2 { color: #dbe8d8; }\n  .readiness-count { font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4vw, 3.4rem); letter-spacing: -.055em; line-height: 1.06; margin-block: 5px 7px; }\n  .hero-note { font-size: .875rem; color: #e3ece0; }\n  .time-control { background: #f6f5eb; color: var(--forest); border-radius: 11px; padding: 13px 15px; }\n  .time-control label { display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; }\n  input {\n    width: 100%; min-width: 0; background: var(--card); color: var(--ink);\n    border: 1px solid #a7b3a5; border-radius: 7px; padding: 7px 9px;\n    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  }\n  .time-control input { padding-inline: 10px; font-weight: 700; }\n  .stock { margin-top: 25px; }\n  .section-title { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 5px 12px; margin-bottom: 11px; }\n  .section-title button { font-size: .8125rem; }\n  .section-title p, .subtle { color: var(--muted); font-size: .875rem; }\n  .inventory { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 13px; }\n  .stat { padding: 12px 16px 13px; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; }\n  .stat h3 { margin: 0; font-size: .875rem; font-weight: 700; }\n  .stat-main { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px; margin-block: 3px 4px; }\n  .stat-value { font-size: 2.05rem; line-height: 1.1; }\n  .stat-meta { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 7px; }\n  .work { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.85fr) minmax(300px, 1fr); align-items: start; gap: 17px; margin-top: 24px; }\n  .panel { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); min-width: 0; }\n  .panel-head { padding: 17px 17px 13px; }\n  .panel-head p { margin-top: 5px; }\n  .rooms { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: left; }\n  .rooms th, .rooms td { padding: 8px 8px; }\n  .rooms th:first-child, .rooms td:first-child { padding-left: 17px; }\n  .rooms th:last-child, .rooms td:last-child { padding-right: 17px; }\n  .rooms thead th { background: #eeefe6; color: #4a594f; }\n  .rooms tbody td, .rooms tbody th { border-bottom: 1px solid #e7e6dc; }\n  .rooms tbody tr:last-child > * { border-bottom: 0; }\n  .room-number { font-size: 1.33rem; white-space: nowrap; line-height: 1.15; }\n  .room-type, .need { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: .8125rem; font-weight: 400; }\n  .need { color: var(--ink); }\n  .badge {\n    display: inline-block; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 5px; background: #eeefe7;\n    color: #49574d; font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .badge[data-status=\"ready\"], .badge[data-status=\"received\"] { background: var(--moss); color: #234834; }\n  .badge[data-status=\"expected\"], .badge[data-status=\"pending\"] { background: var(--amber); color: #67450d; }\n  .badge[data-status=\"short\"] { background: #f4e1d8; color: var(--rust); }\n  .room-detail { display: block; margin-top: 3px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .75rem; }\n  .room-detail[hidden] { display: none; }\n  .room-action { text-align: right; }\n  .room-action button { min-width: 82px; font-size: .8125rem; padding-inline: 9px; }\n  .room-action button[data-reserved=\"true\"] { border-color: #688771; background: #e5eee1; }\n  .room-action button[data-reserved=\"true\"]:hover { background: #d6e5d2; }\n  .panel-foot { padding: 11px 17px 13px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }\n  .laundry .panel-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 9px; }\n  .laundry-table { width: calc(100% - 34px); margin: 0 17px; border-collapse: collapse; }\n  .laundry-table th, .laundry-table td { border-bottom: 1px solid #e7e6dc; padding: 8px 3px; text-align: right; }\n  .laundry-table th:first-child { text-align: left; }\n  .laundry-table thead { color: var(--muted); }\n  .laundry-table tbody th { font-weight: 600; font-size: .875rem; }\n  .laundry-table td { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n  .laundry-bottom { padding: 12px 17px 16px; }\n  .laundry-bottom p { min-height: 2.6em; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .laundry-bottom button { width: 100%; }\n  .feedback { margin: 13px 0 0; font-size: .875rem; color: var(--forest); }\n  .feedback:empty { margin: 0; }\n  .feedback[data-error=\"true\"], .error { color: var(--rust); }\n  dialog {\n    background: var(--card); color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius);\n    padding: 22px; width: min(448px, calc(100% - 28px)); max-height: calc(100% - 28px);\n  }\n  dialog::backdrop { background: #17291fcc; }\n  dialog p { margin-block: 7px 13px; }\n  .receipt-fields { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 8px; margin-top: 11px; }\n  form label { display: block; font-size: .875rem; font-weight: 650; }\n  form label input { display: block; margin-top: 5px; }\n  .dialog-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 16px; justify-content: flex-end; }\n  .error { font-size: .875rem; }\n  .error:empty { display: none; }\n  .sr-only {\n    position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px;\n    overflow: hidden; clip-path: inset(50%); white-space: nowrap; border: 0;\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 885px) {\n    .wrap { width: calc(100% - 36px); }\n    .work { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 540px) {\n    .wrap { width: calc(100% - 24px); }\n    main { padding-top: 23px; }\n    .hero { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 13px; padding: 16px; }\n    .time-control { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; }\n    .time-control label { margin: 0; }\n    .time-control input { width: min(58%, 160px); }\n    .inventory { gap: 6px; }\n    .stat { padding: 9px; }\n    .stat-main { display: block; }\n    .stat-main span { display: block; }\n    .stat-meta { font-size: .75rem; }\n    .rooms th, .rooms td { padding-inline: 4px; }\n    .rooms th:first-child, .rooms td:first-child { padding-left: 9px; }\n    .rooms th:last-child, .rooms td:last-child { padding-right: 9px; }\n    .room-number { font-size: 1.12rem; white-space: normal; }\n    .room-action button { min-width: 0; padding-inline: 6px; }\n  }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { * { transition: none !important; } }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header class=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"wrap top-inner\">\n    <div class=\"brand\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Linen board</div>\n    <div class=\"save-state\" id=\"save-state\">Saved on this device</div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"intro\">\n    <h1>Saturday turnover</h1>\n    <p>Three same-day arrivals across five guest rooms.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"hero\" aria-labelledby=\"readiness-title\">\n    <div aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">\n      <h2 id=\"readiness-title\">Linen readiness</h2>\n      <p class=\"readiness-count\" id=\"readiness-count\"></p>\n      <p class=\"hero-note\" id=\"readiness-note\"></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"time-control\">\n      <label for=\"cutoff\">Prepare by</label>\n      <input id=\"cutoff\" type=\"time\" value=\"12:00\" required>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stock\" aria-labelledby=\"stock-title\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">\n      <div><h2 id=\"stock-title\">Clean stock</h2><p>Physical stock available to reserve</p></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"stock-open\">Edit opening count</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"inventory\" id=\"inventory\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"work\">\n    <section class=\"panel\" aria-labelledby=\"rooms-title\">\n      <div class=\"panel-head\">\n        <h2 id=\"rooms-title\">Room plan</h2>\n        <p class=\"subtle\">Rooms 1, 2 and 4 depart and arrive on Saturday.</p>\n      </div>\n      <table class=\"rooms\" aria-labelledby=\"rooms-title\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr class=\"small-heading\"><th scope=\"col\">Room</th><th scope=\"col\">Linen needed</th><th scope=\"col\" id=\"room-cutoff\">By 12:00</th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Reservation</span></th></tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody id=\"room-rows\"></tbody>\n      </table>\n      <p class=\"panel-foot subtle\">Reserved rooms get first claim. Remaining clean kits go to arrivals in room order.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"panel laundry\" aria-labelledby=\"laundry-title\">\n      <div class=\"panel-head\">\n        <div><h2 id=\"laundry-title\">Laundry return</h2><p class=\"subtle\">Expected Saturday at <strong>13:00</strong></p></div>\n        <span class=\"badge\" id=\"receipt-status\"></span>\n      </div>\n      <table class=\"laundry-table\" aria-labelledby=\"laundry-title\">\n        <thead><tr class=\"small-heading\"><th scope=\"col\">Linen</th><th scope=\"col\">Expected</th><th scope=\"col\">Received</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody id=\"laundry-rows\"></tbody>\n      </table>\n      <div class=\"laundry-bottom\">\n        <p class=\"subtle\" id=\"receipt-note\"></p>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"primary\" id=\"receipt-open\">Record return</button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"feedback\" id=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></p>\n</main>\n\n<dialog id=\"receipt-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"receipt-title\">\n  <form id=\"receipt-form\">\n    <h2 id=\"receipt-title\">Record laundry return</h2>\n    <p class=\"subtle\" id=\"receipt-help\">Enter the actual time and clean quantities received. This updates the recorded total for the 13:00 batch.</p>\n    <label for=\"received-time\">Received at\n      <input id=\"received-time\" name=\"time\" type=\"time\" value=\"13:00\" required aria-describedby=\"receipt-help\" autofocus>\n    </label>\n    <div class=\"receipt-fields\">\n      <label for=\"received-queen\">Queen sets<input id=\"received-queen\" name=\"queen\" type=\"number\" inputmode=\"numeric\" min=\"0\" max=\"9999\" step=\"1\" required></label>\n      <label for=\"received-twin\">Twin sets<input id=\"received-twin\" name=\"twin\" type=\"number\" inputmode=\"numeric\" min=\"0\" max=\"9999\" step=\"1\" required></label>\n      <label for=\"received-towels\">Towels<input id=\"received-towels\" name=\"towels\" type=\"number\" inputmode=\"numeric\" min=\"0\" max=\"9999\" step=\"1\" required></label>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"error\" id=\"receipt-error\" role=\"alert\"></p>\n    <div class=\"dialog-actions\">\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"receipt-cancel\">Cancel</button>\n      <button type=\"submit\" class=\"primary\">Save return</button>\n    </div>\n  </form>\n</dialog>\n<dialog id=\"stock-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"opening-title\">\n  <form id=\"stock-form\">\n    <h2 id=\"opening-title\">Edit opening count</h2>\n    <p class=\"subtle\">Enter Saturday’s starting clean stock, before the laundry return and room reservations.</p>\n    <div class=\"receipt-fields\">\n      <label for=\"opening-queen\">Queen sets<input id=\"opening-queen\" name=\"queen\" type=\"number\" inputmode=\"numeric\" min=\"0\" max=\"9999\" step=\"1\" required autofocus></label>\n      <label for=\"opening-twin\">Twin sets<input id=\"opening-twin\" name=\"twin\" type=\"number\" inputmode=\"numeric\" min=\"0\" max=\"9999\" step=\"1\" required></label>\n      <label for=\"opening-towels\">Towels<input id=\"opening-towels\" name=\"towels\" type=\"number\" inputmode=\"numeric\" min=\"0\" max=\"9999\" step=\"1\" required></label>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"error\" id=\"stock-error\" role=\"alert\"></p>\n    <div class=\"dialog-actions\">\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"stock-cancel\">Cancel</button>\n      <button type=\"submit\" class=\"primary\">Save count</button>\n    </div>\n  </form>\n</dialog>\n<noscript><p class=\"wrap\">Enable JavaScript in your browser to use the board offline.</p></noscript>\n\n<script>\n\"use strict\";\n\nconst supplies = [\n  { key: \"queen\", label: \"Queen sets\", singular: \"queen set\", expected: 2 },\n  { key: \"twin\", label: \"Twin sets\", singular: \"twin set\", expected: 2 },\n  { key: \"towels\", label: \"Towels\", singular: \"towel\", expected: 6 }\n];\nconst expectedTime = \"13:00\";\nconst empty = { queen: 0, twin: 0, towels: 0 };\nconst queenKit = { ...empty, queen: 1, towels: 2 };\nconst twinKit = { ...empty, twin: 2, towels: 2 };\nconst rooms = [\n  { id: 1, type: \"Queen\", arrival: true, kit: queenKit },\n  { id: 2, type: \"Queen\", arrival: true, kit: queenKit },\n  { id: 3, type: \"Queen\", arrival: false, kit: queenKit },\n  { id: 4, type: \"Twin\", arrival: true, kit: twinKit },\n  { id: 5, type: \"Twin\", arrival: false, kit: twinKit }\n];\nconst arrivals = rooms.filter(room => room.arrival);\nconst initial = {\n  opening: { queen: 2, twin: 3, towels: 8 },\n  receipt: null,\n  reserved: [],\n  cutoff: \"12:00\"\n};\nconst storageKey = \"guesthouse-linen-saturday-v1\";\nconst byId = id => document.getElementById(id);\nconst quantities = calculate => Object.fromEntries(supplies.map(({ key }) => [key, calculate(key)]));\nconst isTime = value => typeof value === \"string\" && /^(?:[01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d$/.test(value);\nconst isCount = value => Number.isInteger(value) && value >= 0 && value <= 9999;\nconst validQuantities = value => value && supplies.every(({ key }) => isCount(value[key]));\nconst covers = (stock, kit) => supplies.every(({ key }) => stock[key] >= kit[key]);\nconst add = (left, right) => quantities(key => left[key] + right[key]);\nconst physical = plan => add(plan.opening, plan.receipt?.counts ?? empty);\n\nfunction heldStock(plan) {\n  return arrivals.filter(room => plan.reserved.includes(room.id))\n    .reduce((total, room) => add(total, room.kit), empty);\n}\n\nfunction validPlan(plan) {\n  return plan && validQuantities(plan.opening) && isTime(plan.cutoff)\n    && (plan.receipt === null || (plan.receipt && isTime(plan.receipt.time) && validQuantities(plan.receipt.counts)))\n    && Array.isArray(plan.reserved) && new Set(plan.reserved).size === plan.reserved.length\n    && plan.reserved.every(id => arrivals.some(room => room.id === id))\n    && covers(physical(plan), heldStock(plan));\n}\n\nfunction preview(plan) {\n  const receiptByCutoff = plan.receipt && plan.receipt.time <= plan.cutoff;\n  let available = add(plan.opening, receiptByCutoff ? plan.receipt.counts : empty);\n  const reserved = plan.reserved.map(id => arrivals.find(room => room.id === id));\n  const unreserved = arrivals.filter(room => !plan.reserved.includes(room.id));\n  const result = new Map();\n\n  for (const room of [...reserved, ...unreserved]) {\n    const missing = shortages(available, room.kit);\n    if (covers(available, room.kit)) {\n      result.set(room.id, { status: \"ready\", detail: \"\" });\n    } else {\n      result.set(room.id, { status: \"short\", detail: \"Needs \" + pieces(missing) });\n    }\n    if (result.get(room.id).status === \"ready\" || plan.reserved.includes(room.id)) {\n      available = remaining(available, room.kit);\n    }\n  }\n\n  if (!plan.receipt && expectedTime <= plan.cutoff) {\n    available = add(available, Object.fromEntries(supplies.map(({ key, expected }) => [key, expected])));\n    for (const room of unreserved.filter(room => result.get(room.id).status === \"short\")) {\n      if (covers(available, room.kit)) {\n        result.set(room.id, { status: \"expected\", detail: \"Laundry due at \" + expectedTime });\n        available = remaining(available, room.kit);\n      } else {\n        result.set(room.id, { status: \"short\", detail: \"Needs \" + pieces(shortages(available, room.kit)) });\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  return result;\n}\n\nfunction shortages(stock, kit) {\n  return quantities(key => Math.max(0, kit[key] - stock[key]));\n}\n\nfunction remaining(stock, kit) {\n  return quantities(key => Math.max(0, stock[key] - kit[key]));\n}\n\nfunction pieces(counts) {\n  return supplies.filter(({ key }) => counts[key] > 0)\n    .map(({ key, singular }) => counts[key] + \" \" + singular + (counts[key] === 1 ? \"\" : \"s\")).join(\", \");\n}\n\nfunction setStorageStatus(message, error = false) {\n  const label = byId(\"save-state\");\n  label.textContent = message;\n  label.dataset.error = error;\n}\n\nfunction load() {\n  let saved;\n  try {\n    saved = localStorage.getItem(storageKey);\n  } catch {\n    setStorageStatus(\"Changes last for this session\", true);\n    return initial;\n  }\n  if (saved === null) return initial;\n  try {\n    const plan = JSON.parse(saved);\n    if (validPlan(plan)) return plan;\n  } catch {\n    // Opening counts remain usable if a stored plan cannot be read.\n  }\n  setStorageStatus(\"Saved plan unreadable · showing opening counts\", true);\n  return initial;\n}\n\nlet state = load();\n\nfunction feedback(message, error = false) {\n  const label = byId(\"feedback\");\n  label.dataset.error = error;\n  label.textContent = message;\n}\n\nfunction commit(next, message = \"\") {\n  state = next;\n  try {\n    localStorage.setItem(storageKey, JSON.stringify(state));\n    setStorageStatus(\"Saved on this device\");\n  } catch {\n    setStorageStatus(\"Changes last for this session\", true);\n  }\n  render();\n  feedback(message);\n}\n\nfunction buildBoard() {\n  byId(\"inventory\").innerHTML = supplies.map(({ key, label }) => `\n    <article class=\"stat\">\n      <h3>${label}</h3>\n      <div class=\"stat-main\"><strong class=\"stat-value\" id=\"free-${key}\"></strong><span class=\"subtle\">available</span></div>\n      <p class=\"stat-meta subtle\" id=\"meta-${key}\"></p>\n    </article>`).join(\"\");\n\n  byId(\"laundry-rows\").innerHTML = supplies.map(({ key, label, expected }) => `\n    <tr><th scope=\"row\">${label}</th><td>${expected}</td><td id=\"actual-${key}\"></td></tr>`).join(\"\");\n\n  byId(\"room-rows\").innerHTML = rooms.map(({ id, type, kit, arrival }) => `\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"room-number\">Room ${id}</span><span class=\"room-type\">${type}</span></th>\n      <td>${supplies.filter(({ key }) => kit[key]).map(({ key, singular }) =>\n        `<span class=\"need\">${kit[key]} ${singular}${kit[key] === 1 ? \"\" : \"s\"}</span>`).join(\"\")}</td>\n      <td><span class=\"badge\" id=\"status-${id}\">No turnover</span><span class=\"room-detail\" id=\"detail-${id}\" hidden></span></td>\n      <td class=\"room-action\">${arrival ? `<button type=\"button\" id=\"reserve-${id}\">Reserve</button>` : \"\"}</td>\n    </tr>`).join(\"\");\n\n  for (const room of arrivals) {\n    byId(\"reserve-\" + room.id).addEventListener(\"click\", () => toggleReservation(room));\n  }\n}\n\nfunction render() {\n  const outcomes = preview(state);\n  const held = heldStock(state);\n  const onHand = physical(state);\n  const free = quantities(key => onHand[key] - held[key]);\n  const ready = [...outcomes.values()].filter(({ status }) => status === \"ready\").length;\n  const expected = [...outcomes.values()].filter(({ status }) => status === \"expected\").length;\n  const short = arrivals.length - ready - expected;\n  const summary = [ready + \" from clean stock\"];\n  if (expected) summary.push(expected + \" relying on expected laundry\");\n  if (short) summary.push(short + \" short of linen\");\n  byId(\"readiness-count\").textContent = (ready + expected) + \" of \" + arrivals.length + \" rooms by \" + state.cutoff;\n  byId(\"readiness-note\").textContent = summary.join(\" · \");\n  byId(\"room-cutoff\").textContent = \"By \" + state.cutoff;\n\n  for (const { key } of supplies) {\n    byId(\"free-\" + key).textContent = free[key];\n    byId(\"meta-\" + key).textContent = onHand[key] + \" clean · \" + held[key] + \" reserved\";\n    const actualCell = byId(\"actual-\" + key);\n    actualCell.textContent = state.receipt?.counts[key] ?? \"—\";\n    if (state.receipt) actualCell.removeAttribute(\"aria-label\");\n    else actualCell.setAttribute(\"aria-label\", \"Awaiting receipt\");\n  }\n\n  for (const room of arrivals) {\n    const outcome = outcomes.get(room.id);\n    const reserved = state.reserved.includes(room.id);\n    const badge = byId(\"status-\" + room.id);\n    badge.dataset.status = outcome.status;\n    badge.textContent = { ready: \"Linen ready\", expected: \"Expected\", short: \"Short\" }[outcome.status];\n    const detail = byId(\"detail-\" + room.id);\n    detail.textContent = [reserved ? \"Reserved\" : \"\", outcome.detail].filter(Boolean).join(\" · \");\n    detail.hidden = !detail.textContent;\n    const button = byId(\"reserve-\" + room.id);\n    button.dataset.reserved = reserved;\n    button.textContent = reserved ? \"Release\" : \"Reserve\";\n    button.setAttribute(\"aria-label\", (reserved ? \"Release linen for room \" : \"Reserve linen for room \") + room.id);\n    button.disabled = !reserved && !covers(free, room.kit);\n  }\n\n  const receiptBadge = byId(\"receipt-status\");\n  receiptBadge.textContent = state.receipt ? \"Received\" : \"Pending\";\n  receiptBadge.dataset.status = state.receipt ? \"received\" : \"pending\";\n  byId(\"receipt-note\").textContent = state.receipt\n    ? \"Recorded at \" + state.receipt.time + \". Actual counts are used for planning.\"\n    : \"Included in the forecast from 13:00. Record the return to make it available to reserve.\";\n  byId(\"receipt-open\").textContent = state.receipt ? \"Edit return\" : \"Record return\";\n}\n\nfunction toggleReservation(room) {\n  const reserved = state.reserved.includes(room.id);\n  const next = {\n    ...state,\n    reserved: reserved ? state.reserved.filter(id => id !== room.id) : [...state.reserved, room.id]\n  };\n  if (!covers(physical(next), heldStock(next))) {\n    feedback(\"A full clean kit is unavailable for room \" + room.id + \".\", true);\n    return;\n  }\n  commit(next, \"Linen \" + (reserved ? \"released for\" : \"reserved for\") + \" room \" + room.id + \".\");\n}\n\nfunction readCounts(form) {\n  return quantities(key => {\n    const value = form.elements.namedItem(key).value;\n    return value === \"\" ? NaN : Number(value);\n  });\n}\n\nfunction writeCounts(form, counts) {\n  for (const { key } of supplies) form.elements.namedItem(key).value = counts?.[key] ?? \"\";\n}\n\nfunction connectEditor(name, fill, update, message) {\n  const dialog = byId(name + \"-dialog\");\n  const form = byId(name + \"-form\");\n  const error = byId(name + \"-error\");\n  byId(name + \"-open\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n    fill(form);\n    error.textContent = \"\";\n    dialog.showModal();\n  });\n  byId(name + \"-cancel\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => dialog.close());\n  form.addEventListener(\"submit\", event => {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    const next = update(form);\n    if (!validQuantities(next.opening) || (next.receipt && !validQuantities(next.receipt.counts))) {\n      error.textContent = \"Enter a whole number from 0 to 9999 for each linen type.\";\n      return;\n    }\n    if (next.receipt && !isTime(next.receipt.time)) {\n      error.textContent = \"Enter the Saturday time when the laundry was received.\";\n      return;\n    }\n    if (!covers(physical(next), heldStock(next))) {\n      error.textContent = \"These counts cannot cover the current reservations. Release the affected rooms before reducing stock.\";\n      return;\n    }\n    commit(next, message);\n    dialog.close();\n  });\n}\n\nbuildBoard();\nbyId(\"cutoff\").value = state.cutoff;\nbyId(\"cutoff\").addEventListener(\"input\", event => {\n  if (isTime(event.target.value)) commit({ ...state, cutoff: event.target.value });\n});\nbyId(\"cutoff\").addEventListener(\"change\", event => {\n  if (!isTime(event.target.value)) event.target.value = state.cutoff;\n});\nbyId(\"cutoff\").addEventListener(\"blur\", event => {\n  if (!isTime(event.target.value)) event.target.value = state.cutoff;\n});\n\nconnectEditor(\"receipt\", form => {\n  byId(\"receipt-title\").textContent = state.receipt ? \"Edit laundry return\" : \"Record laundry return\";\n  form.elements.namedItem(\"time\").value = state.receipt?.time ?? expectedTime;\n  writeCounts(form, state.receipt?.counts);\n}, form => ({\n  ...state,\n  receipt: { time: form.elements.namedItem(\"time\").value, counts: readCounts(form) }\n}), \"Laundry return saved.\");\n\nconnectEditor(\"stock\", form => writeCounts(form, state.opening), form => ({\n  ...state,\n  opening: readCounts(form)\n}), \"Opening stock saved.\");\n\nwindow.addEventListener(\"storage\", event => {\n  if (event.key !== storageKey && event.key !== null) return;\n  state = load();\n  byId(\"cutoff\").value = state.cutoff;\n  render();\n});\nrender();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}],"download":"data/release/assets/61bcf6ca4ca0fccd0a85ead3a66dd8bad9ec24a5da60402553582cac3904821b.zip"}}}
